{
    desc => q{Bracket match % square brackets},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `%` jumps between matching square brackets

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/bracket_match_square`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `my @items = [1, 2, 3];`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0

Keys: `12l` (move to `[`)

**on_bracket.png** (cursor on `[`):
- Cursor at line 1, col 12 (on `[`)

Keys: `%`

**after_action.png** (after `%`):
- Cursor at line 1, col 20 (on `]` matching `[` at col 12)
- No text change

END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->editor->set_language('perl');
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('12l');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('on_bracket');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('%');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_action');
    },
}
